                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr.
                            Young.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-02-06"><hi rendition="#italic">February 6,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Renton claim held in abeyance reasonable time to await result criminal
                    prosecution.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Olney.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
